Package: joinpointR
Title: Tidy Tools for Joinpoint Regression Models
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        "Tamara", "Ricardo", , 
        email ="tamararicardo83@gmail.com", 
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0921-2611"))
Description: Provides tools to fit joinpoint regression models with a log-linear specification by levels of one or two categorical variable(s) using the grid-search method. It includes functions to estimate the Annual Percent Change (APC) and the Average Annual Percent Change (AAPC), along with their 95% confidence intervals, and to generate formatted summary tables and plots of results.
